WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.610
The furious rain, Makes my heart shake
hageshii ame ga, kokoro wo yuruwaseru

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.820
Like it did on that day
Ano hi no youni

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.910
But I just ran through, In my dream I had till yesterday
Tada hashirinuketa, kinou made no MY DREAM

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.710
...I still believe
...shinjiteiru no sa

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.470
I'm willing to fight, An endless defense
Owari no nai, defense demo ii yo

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:42.350
As long as you, Keep on gazing at me
Kimi ga boku wo, mitsumetsuzukete kureru nara

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.270
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
Turn to face all the mornings ahead, And someday
Ikutsumono asa wo mukae, Itsuka kitto

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.860
Try to seize them
tsukande miseru

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.450
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:02.120
Even if nothing, Lies on the other side
Sono mukougawa ni, nanimonakutemo

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.040
It doesn't matter to me
kamawanai kara

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:14.050
...Just as long as I can embrace, Your gentle, irreplaceable smile!
Kakegae no nai, kimi no yasashii egao daite

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.900
THE SOUND OF THE GUILLOTINE

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:25.700
"The Sound of the Guillotine".

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:25.860
THE SOUND OF THE GUILLOTINE

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:36.230
We've found him. Ltjg. Cronicle Asher is safe.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:39.800
Of course. The lieutenant is a tenacious man.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.100
The Gattarl team is signaling us.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:42.960
Patch it through.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:43.630
Yes, ma'am!

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:48.730
Lt. Duker Iq. Those bikes should be agile enough for you.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.530
They're nearby?

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:54.800
I see.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.760
Then it's time we trapped the League Militaire.

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:08.730
We'll be picked up soon. Just be patient a bit longer.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:11.130
Now begins the real test of endurance, right?

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:12.300
I suppose.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.760
I returned the white mobile suit, so I'm going home.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:28.530
After all you did to get back to the Camion, you're leaving?

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.660
You're worried about Shahkti, aren't you?

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:36.900
The count and Miss Katejina are in for a tough time, huh?

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:42.360
Truth serum could cause brain damage.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.460
Mr. Romero!

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.800
It's how BESPA does things.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.060
You should go back to Kasarelia.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.560
After all, we have a complete Victory-type mobile suit now.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:55.030
Sorry.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:07.230
Where's Üso going?

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:09.730
Isn't Kasarelia that way?

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:13.400
Kasarelia... It's a nice place to live, huh?

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.460
And he's got that computer bank.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.060
True.

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:22.830
What are you up to?

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.230
We're gonna patrol this area.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.630
Wait!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:17.430
You're kind of young to be a mother.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:18.760
Haro! Haro!

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.630
That's a high-grade robot.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:24.000
Do you work for the League Militaire?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.160
There, there, it's okay.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:30.660
Let's go!

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.700
Haro! Haro!

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.630
Oh, Karlmann!

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:54.730
Üso! Wait!

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.260
Üso!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:04:59.730
What's that?

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:01.460
It's a plane.

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:05.300
Never seen one like that before.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.700
Üso's headed down there!

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.160
Down there, huh...

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:13.460
Okay, hang on tight!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.030
Odelo!

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:14.430
Don't! Odelo!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.700
Don't!

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:17.430
It's not that high!

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:32.960
What's up?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.000
We did it!

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:36.700
There! Up there!

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.930
Is it from the Yellow Jackets?

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.330
Yeah.

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:45.030
I figured you were so wrapped up in going home...

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:47.030
...that you might not have noticed it.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.030
Thanks.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.700
What are you all doing here, anyway?

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:55.460
Üso! You're going back to Kasarelia, right?

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:57.400
Yeah.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:05.060
Count Oi Nyung? Quite a souvenir.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.500
I appreciate it, Ltjg. Cronicle Asher.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.460
The commander of Largaine base, Fuala Griffon.

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.100
I'm honored that you know my name.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:17.360
A member of the League Militaire?

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.330
No, she's a victim from Uwig.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.230
I see.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:25.460
Lieutenant...

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.100
You shouldn't trust a woman carelessly.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:32.760
That's my advice to you as a woman.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:33.560
Right.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:45.560
Jeez... They're planning to live in Kasarelia.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:47.560
What's that?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.830
It could only be the Yellow Jackets out here.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:54.830
Now what?

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.360
We'd better ditch this bazooka.

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.360
You've got something like that with you?

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.330
It'd be a waste to just throw it away.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:02.760
But...

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:07.100
Okay, I'll act sick! Give me your coat.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:09.530
Sick? Coat?

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:11.630
Look, like this.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.630
Oh, you're hiding it!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.830
We can hide his legs with your coat, Odelo!

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:17.600
Here.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:18.360
Thanks.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:20.630
Üso, lend us your jacket.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.800
Here.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:23.760
Hey!

00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:26.760
We'll say we're heading for a doctor, okay?

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:27.930
Gotcha.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:33.900
What are you doing?

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:36.960
Okay, that's got it.

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:58.600
He's got a fever, all right.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.030
You'd better get going.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:02.900
We can?

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.100
I don't have time to waste with children.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:07.600
Thanks!

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:15.100
BESPA has landed ground forces on Earth, now.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:20.960
You really do have a fever!

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:25.000
I get fevers when I'm nervous. It'll drop soon.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.930
Üso, now what?

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:30.060
They're probably looking for the old guys on the Camion.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.200
We can't just ignore it, but...

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:35.330
Why did this have to happen?

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:42.800
Shahkti, Kasarelia isn't in this direction!

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:46.330
Quiet! We need to warn the Camion!

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:51.500
Well, well, so here they are. Start your engines!

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:52.300
Yes, sir!

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.760
Here, of all places?!

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:05.500
Let's do it!

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:06.330
Okay!

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:18.960
Marbet, I know your leg hurts, but draw their attention off us!

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:22.800
My leg's fine! Core fighter, launching!

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.600
Don't hit the core fighter!

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:34.630
They can't get away in a place like this!

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:40.500
It's those guys from before! What about the Camion?

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.360
I think it's right below us, but...

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.030
Miss Marbet!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.830
There's no way to dock in this situation!

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:50.530
Miss Marbet!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.860
Raise the head and increase your thrust!

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:56.700
Odelo, the bikes are massed in front of us!

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:58.030
Draw their fire!

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:00.100
Okay? Keep firing that bazooka!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.400
Got that, Suzy?

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:05.100
Next!

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:06.100
Hang on!

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:08.030
We need to draw their fire!

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:09.130
I know!

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:20.830
That's it, Warren!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:22.630
Is your leg okay?

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:25.460
B-Barely... How's the plane?

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:26.760
Nothing's wrong.

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.900
The smoke's stopped, so I think it's fine.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.830
You don't know how many of those quasi-Gundams they have?

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:34.000
No, I couldn't determine that.

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:37.560
And our bombing obliterated the factory?

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:42.530
Yes, but the League Militaire may have expanded their production.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:46.760
Okay, let go.

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:50.460
Get going, Üso.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.960
Get on the wappa with Odelo and the others.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:54.300
Odelo!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:56.160
Come on!

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:57.330
Okay.

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:01.860
The fighter!

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:04.860
Odelo, Marbet is down!

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.030
What?! I can barely hear you!

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.360
Marbet!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:14.830
Ammo!

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:38.160
Scatter! Go away! Go somewhere else!

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.260
The core fighter's out of ammunition!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.300
Can we launch the Boots or Hanger for her?

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:56.900
Otis, send out the Hanger! Kuffu, Ness, send out the Boots!

00:11:56.960 --> 00:12:00.930
Ness, can you tell Kuffu when the core fighter comes back?

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.030
Roger!

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:07.300
Romero! You all right?!

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:11.460
T-Thank goodness it was a dud! This pod is full!

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:17.060
Ness, I can launch the Boots anytime!

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.360
She's finally here!

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:22.130
Marbet, you can't do anything without weapons!

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:25.360
Marbet! It's those kids!

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:28.100
Here it comes! Launch!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:30.900
I can't hold them back without weapons.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.560
Send out the Boots and Hanger!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.160
Kuffu, launch it!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.060
Braking!

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.030
It docked?!

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.530
This is nothing to me,

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:02.730
the one who revived the tradition of biking from the old century!

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:08.230
Who's fighting?

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:13.430
Miss Marbet? Or Üso?

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:20.060
What's coming?

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.860
Lt. Arbeo Pippiniden.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:50.600
I'm detecting Minovsky particles.

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:54.030
There's a battle going on in the airspace below us.

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:55.860
I'm reading it, too.

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:01.360
My greeting to Largaine's commander Fuala Griffon comes first.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.130
Yes, sir.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:05.560
Can Kisarolia team give some support to the ground?

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:08.000
Just what I hoped you'd say.

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:12.130
Once you're used to fighting in the atmosphere and gravity,

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:13.800
rendezvous with us at Largaine.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:14.500
Yes, sir!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.130
This is the power of the Gattarl team!

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.960
I wouldn't be doing this if you weren't attacking!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.560
You fool! I said I wouldn't shoot if you'd just stay away!

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:51.730
Stay away!

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.930
Üso, we're sending out the Hanger! Dock with it!

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:08.000
Don't force me to be a killer! Please!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.700
Romero, Üso is screaming about something.

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:11.700
Is he?

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:13.400
Sending out the Hanger! There!

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.530
Why'd you have to send out the Hanger?!

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.130
It turned into a mobile suit!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.900
A-A white mobile suit!

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:34.560
Just like the old Gundam!

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:40.100
Go away!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:42.560
Go away, or you're all going to die!

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.130
Its weapons are stronger, now?

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:47.060
He's gotten half the team!

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:48.130
I know!

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:50.960
As befits my rival!

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:56.530
Why, you!

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:06.760
Now he's done it!

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.930
This time, I'll get you for real!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.000
There's more?!

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:24.130
Count Oi Nyung, would you please just tell us?

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:28.000
Where are your factories scattered around Europe?

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:29.700
And where is Jinn Jahannam?

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:31.800
What?

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:35.660
He says you should just use truth serum on him.

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:36.930
We can't.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:40.730
If he chooses to talk, then he'll know he's defeated.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.430
Remove the mouthpiece.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.360
Yes, ma'am!

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:51.100
I hate using these methods of torture. Don't you, Count?

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:57.560
I'm sorry. I do, as well. And my life is over.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.160
Just send me to the guillotine.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:04.000
But if you do, you will only strengthen the unity...

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:07.430
...of the resistance and the League Militaire's staff!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.600
The use of the guillotine in the space colonies...

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.160
...allowed the Zanscare Empire to build...

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:16.560
...a new nation in a short period of time.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:20.230
You seem to have misread its meaning, Count.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.400
Then go ahead and try!

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:40.700
So, the Pippiniden battalion made planetfall today?

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:43.460
Lieutenant Iq!

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:51.660
These people don't know the surface!

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:04.300
The next pass will be a little slower...

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.030
I'll go for the rear missile pod!

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:12.100
Did I shoot too late?

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:21.500
I didn't hit the engine or the pilot.

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:32.530
Ltjg. Cronicle is this way?

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:33.500
Yes, sir!

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:36.860
Who's there?

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:38.360
Arbeo Pippiniden.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.160
Lieutenant? Is that you, Lt. Pippiniden?

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:42.930
You look well.

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:48.830
Could you bring us some Earth tea, Miss?

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.230
What did you come to talk about?

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:59.630
I just wanted us to speak as a senior and junior from the academy.

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:01.530
My dear Cronicle Asher.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:02.630
Of course.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.860
That's kind of you, Lieutenant.

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:07.000
Well?

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:10.800
Keilas Guilie has taken a position in geosynchronous orbit,

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.260
and now Captain Tassilo Wago is irritated.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:15.700
About Commander Fuala Griffon's methods?

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.460
Yes.

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:20.930
The deployment of the Tomliat battalion today isn't the end of it.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:23.660
It concerns the establishment of this Largaine base, too.

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:26.630
I've received orders to make some demands.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.460
I beg your pardon, Miss.

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:33.530
It's me. The lieutenant's here, too.

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:35.400
I'll take it.

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:48.500
Kisarolia's taken heavy damage?

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.860
He can make it back, can't he?

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:55.260
He engaged a white mobile suit that used strange tactics?

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:59.300
That thing is the seed of Commander Fuala's troubles.

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:02.160
The resistance has a white mobile suit?

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:06.200
Is this the return of the Gundam?

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:09.400
You had the power to chase them down,

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.600
so how could you allow the enemy to escape?!

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:13.030
Why did you let them go?!

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:15.500
I'm a kid, not an expert!

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:17.300
No! You're a great pilot!

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:20.160
A great soldier we can't do without!

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:24.530
If you don't kill your enemies, they return, looking for payback!

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:26.060
I can't do that!

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:28.960
They aren't the elites who started this war!

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:31.430
These are just people who were recruited into the war!

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.930
I can't kill them while they're trembling!

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:36.530
You must understand, Üso!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:40.730
The Zanscare forces are just using the name of Maria Armonia for their own benefit.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.960
They want to use Earth for themselves!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:48.000
This war isn't like something you learned in your computer games!

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.660
I need to go back to Kasarelia.

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:51.960
This is awful!

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:55.530
We're picking up a broadcast from BESPA's Yellow Jackets!

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:57.100
What do you mean?

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:58.730
They announced it! They announced it!

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:01.030
It's on every channel!

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:04.030
Fuala Griffon of Largaine base...

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:07.500
...is addressing the entire resistance movement in Europe!

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:08.760
Where is that?

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.930
It's Margaret Square in Largaine.

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:13.000
Üso, watch this.

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:18.230
Right. You should all get far, far away.

00:21:18.930 --> 00:21:20.760
Is your wound all right?

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:23.000
It's fine, now.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:27.430
We are the BESPA of Zanscare!

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:30.600
The Yellow Jackets of the Gatie party!

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:34.160
And so, to all who would resist Zanscare,

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:36.360
know that this is what awaits you!

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:29.530
Piercing the sky, Blue lightning
sora wo tsukisasu aoi inazuma

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:35.320
Staining the earth, With the shadow of greed
daichi o someteku, yokubou no kage

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:41.460
Once again, when the nightmare, Envelops the Earth
futatabi akumu ga, sekai wo tsutsumu toki

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:46.790
You hear voices crying out "S.O.S."
"SOS" wo sakebu koe ga kikoeru...

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:54.130
Let proud hope fill your heart
hokoritakaki kibou wo mune ni

00:22:54.720 --> 00:23:03.100
And stand up! Say a prayer for peace!!
tachiagare! heiwa no inori komete!

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:05.100
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:08.980
In every age
itsuno jidai mo

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:14.570
...People take risks for freedom
hito wa jiyuu wo kakete

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.240
The battle goes on
tatakai tsuzukeru

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.920
Fighting all alone in solitude
kodoku na made ni hitori...

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:36.300
Traumatized by the guillotine, Üso returns to Kasarelia.

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:42.060
But a unit of new model mobile suits target the Camion,

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:44.460
attacking continuously, as if in waves.

00:23:44.630 --> 00:23:48.860
Üso goes to swing the Gundam's beam saber!

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:53.600
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:57.200
Next Episode CLASH! WAVE ATTACK
"Clash! Wave Attack".

00:23:57.200 --> 00:23:58.660
Please watch it!

00:23:58.660 --> 00:23:59.860
Next Episode CLASH! WAVE ATTACK
